        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omukama Hezekiya owa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya kuteera engoma, akaba ahikize emyaka amakumi abiri n'etaano, akalemera emyaka amakumi abiri na mwenda, ali omu rubuga Yerusaalemu. Ibara lya nyina nuwe Abiya, muhara wa Zekaliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakora ebisemeza MUKAMA, nka isenkuru Daudi oku yakozire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okwezibwa okw'Enju ya MUKAMA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogw'okubanza ogw'obusinge bwe, omu kwezi okw'okubanza akakingura enyigi z'Enju ya MUKAMA, yaisemeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaleeta banyakatagara n'Abaleevi yabasorooleza omuzigati eya Burugaizooba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yabagambira ati, “Inywe Abaleevi mutege amatu mumpuliirize! Kanu nuko akasumi, mweyeze, mweze n'Enju ya MUKAMA Ruhanga owa Baisenkurwinywe, kandi mwihe oburofu omu kiikaro ekirukwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba baisenkurwitwe batabe beesigwa, baakora ebibiihiza MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu; bakamunaga baiha amaiso ha kiikaro kye, baamuteera amabega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakakinga n'enyigi z'ekisasi, baaraaza etaara, tibaacumiikirra bubbaani, kandi tibahongera Ruhanga owa Isirairi ebihongwa, omu kiikaro ekirukwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA nukwo kubiihirirwa muno Yuda na Isirairi, yabafoora kintu ky'okutiinwa, ky'okuhunaaza, kandi eky'okusoomoza nkooku murukwerorra n'aganyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baisenkurwitwe, nikyo baitiirwe empirima, kandi batabani baitu, bahara baitu na bakazi baitu, nikyo baanyagiirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati mmaliriire kukora endagaano na MUKAMA Ruhanga owa Isirairi, alekere aho kutubiihirirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baana bange, mutaba ntafaaho, habwokuba MUKAMA akabakoma, kwemerra omu maiso ge, kumuheereza, kuba baheereza be, n'okumucumiikirraga obubbaani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo haimukire Abaleevi, Mahasi mutabani w'Amasai, Yoweli mutabani w'Azaliya, aba batabani b'Abakohasi; omu batabani ba Merari, haimukamu Kiisi mutabani w'Abudi, n'Azaliya mutabani wa Yeharereeli; omu Bageresooni, haimukamu Yowa, mutabani wa Zima, n'Edeni mutabani wa Yoa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu batabani b'Elizafaani, haimukamu Simuli na Yehweri; omu batabani b'Asafu, haimukamu Zekaliya na Mataniya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu batabani ba Hemani, haimukamu Yehueli na Simeyi; kandi omu batabani ba Yedusuuni, haimukamu Semaaya na Uziyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasorooza bagenzi baabo, baayeyeza, baataaha, omukama nkooku akaba aragiire naahondera ebigambo bya MUKAMA, kusemeza Enju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baanyakatagara nubo baataahire omu kicweka eky'omunda eky'Enju ya MUKAMA kukisemeza, baaturukya oburofu bwona obu baasangiremu, Abaleevi baabukwata, baabutwara baabunaga omu kasaaru Kedirooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eky'okubanza eky'okwezi okw'okubanza, okweza oku, nubwo baakutandikire, ha kiro ekya munaana eky'okwezi, baahika ha kisasi ky'Enju ya MUKAMA; hanyuma, baamara ebiro munaana nibeeza Enju ya MUKAMA, ha kiro ekya ikumi na mukaaga, baamara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo baagenzire mb'omukama Hezekiya, baamugambira bati, “Enju ya MUKAMA yoona tugisemiize, itambiro ery'ebihongwa eby'okwokya n'ebintu byalyo byona, emeeza enyakuteebwaho omugaati ogw'eziibwe n'ebintu byayo byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu byona omukama Ahazi ebi yanagire ha businge bwe, atakyaina kwikiriza, tubigarwiire, tumazire n'okubyeeza, hati biri omumaiso g'itambiro lya MUKAMA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Hezekiya nukwo kuzinduka nyenkya kara, yasorooza abanyoro b'orubuga, baataaha omunju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baatwara enimi musanju, empaya z'entaama musanju, ebyana by'entaama musanju, n'empaya z'emburabuzi musanju, kibe kihongwa eky'okuganyiza ebibi eby'obukama eby'ekiikaro ekirukwera, n'eby'abantu ba Yuda. Yaragira banyakatagara batabani b'Arooni, bazitambire ha itambiro lya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baita enimi, baakwata esagama, baagimiisira itambiro; baita empaya z'entaama, esagama yazo, baagimiisira itambiro; baita ebyana by'entaama, esagama yazo, baagimiisira itambiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, nubwo baaleesire empaya emburabuzi, ekyonzira eky'okuganyiza ebibi omumaiso g'omukama n'ag'ekitebe kyona, baazitaho emikono, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "banyakatagara baaziita, esagama yazo baagihongera ha itambiro, ebe kihongwa eky'okuganyiza ebibi, okuganyiza Isirairi yoona. Habwokuba omukama akaragira ngu, habeho ekihongwa eky'okwokya, n'ekyonzira eky'okuganyiza ebibi, habwa Isirairi yoona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yata Abaleevi omunju ya MUKAMA, baina ebitaasa, endongo, n'enanga, omukama Daudi, Gaadi omuraguzi w'omukama, na Nasani omurangi nkooku baaragiire; habwokuba, MUKAMA nuwe yaragiire, naaraba omu barangi be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaleevi obu baayemeriire, bakwasire ebintu bya Daudi eby'okuzinisa, na banyakatagara bakwasire amakondere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya yaragira ekihongwa eky'okwokya, kihongerwe ha itambiro. Ekihongwa obu kyatandikire, ekizina eky'okuzinira MUKAMA, nakyo kyatandika, haataho n'amakondere, hamu n'ebintu ebirukugamba ebya Daudi omukama wa Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe kyona kyaramya, abazini baazina, amakondere gaayana; ebi byona byayeyongera okuhika ekihongwa eky'okwokya obu kyahoire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuhonga obu kwahoire, omukama n'abo boona abakaba bali hamu na uwe, baateeza amaju baaramya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Hezekiya n'abanyoro, baaragira Abaleevi kuzina eby'okuhaisaniza MUKAMA, nibeekonyeza ebigambo ebya Daudi n'eby'Asafu omuraguzi. Baahaisaniza basemeriirwe muno, baateeza amaju baaramya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, Hezekiya yagamba ati, “Hati mwehongiire MUKAMA, murugeyo mwirre haihi muleete ebyonzira n'ebihongwa eby'okusiima omunju ya MUKAMA.” Ekitebe kyaleeta ebyonzira n'ebihongwa eby'okusiima; n'abantu boona abakaba baina omutima ogw'engonzi, baaleeta ebihongwa eby'okwokya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhendo ogw'ebihongwa eby'okwokya ebyaleesirwe ekitebe, zikaba nimi nsanju, empaya z'entaama kikumi, n'ebyana by'entaama ebikumi bibiri; ebi byona, kikaba kihongwa eky'okwokya, eky'okuhongera MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ebihongwa ebyayeziibwe, zikaba nimi rukaaga, n'entaama enkumi isatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu banyakatagara, bakaba bali bake muno, ebihongwa eby'okwokya ebi byona, bakaba batarukusobora kubibaaga, bagenzi baabo Abaleevi nukwo kubakonyera, okuhika omulimo obu gwahoire, na banyakatagara abandi obu bayeyereze. Habwokuba, Abaleevi baataga omutima hakweyeza okukira banyakatagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwongera ha bihongwa ebingi eby'okwokya, hakaba haroho ebisajwa eby'ebihongwa eby'okusaba obusinge, kandi hakaba haroho n'ebihongwa eby'ebyokunywa, ebirukugendera hamu n'ebihongwa eby'okwokya. Endamya ey'omunju ya MUKAMA, nukwo yagarwiirweho eti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Hezekiya n'abantu boona, baasemererwa muno, habw'ekintu eki, Ruhanga eki yakoliire abantu; habwokuba, kikaba kya bwango muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
